Package: tensegrity-lm
Version: {version}
Section: science
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: {maintainer}
Installed-Size: {installed_size}
Depends: python3:any (>= {python_minimum}), python3-torch (>= 2.3), python3-numpy (>= 1.23), python3-safetensors (>= 0.4)
Suggests: python3-pyarrow, python3-matplotlib, python3-ipython
Homepage: https://github.com/recursive-ai-dev/tensegrity
Description: byte-level language models with a trainable growth ladder
 Train, evaluate, generate, grow and export byte-level PyTorch language models
 from 1M to 115M parameters. Includes dataset integrity auditing, preflight
 checks, resumable training, continual learning tools and run reports.
 .
 Models and training data are supplied by the user. The package does not
 download models, create services or install Python dependencies with pip.
